    {
      "source": "Synchronous, <strong>blocking</strong> call returns once the <a href=\"Subscription.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>Subscription</code></a> becomes <a href=\"#isActive()\"><code>active</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>timeout</code></a> exceeds.",
      "translation": "同步的、<strong>阻塞式</strong> 调用会在 <a href=\"Subscription.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>Subscription</code></a> 变为 <a href=\"#isActive()\"><code>active</code></a> 或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>timeout</code></a> 超时时返回。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"Subscription.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>Subscription</code></a> is the link between the <a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>SubscriptionRequest</code></a> and the actual running <a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>Task</code></a>.\n<br/>\nDue to the asynchronous nature of the <a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>Task</code></a> execution a <a href=\"Subscription.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>Subscription</code></a> might not immediately become\nactive. <a href=\"#isActive()\"><code>isActive()</code></a> provides an answer if the underlying <a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging\"><code>Task</code></a> is already running.\n<br/>",
      "translation": "<a href=\"Subscription.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>Subscription</code></a> 是 <a href=\"SubscriptionRequest.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>SubscriptionRequest</code></a> 与实际运行的 <a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>Task</code></a> 之间的桥梁。\n<br/>\n由于 <a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>Task</code></a> 的执行是异步的，<a href=\"Subscription.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>Subscription</code></a> 可能不会立即变为活动状态。<a href=\"#isActive()\"><code>isActive()</code></a> 可用于判断底层的 <a href=\"Task.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.messaging 中的接口\"><code>Task</code></a> 是否已经开始运行。\n<br/>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>true</code> if the subscription was activated. <code>false</code> if the waiting time elapsed before task was\n        activated.",
      "translation": "如果订阅已激活，则返回 <code>true</code>；如果在任务激活前等待时间已过，则返回 <code>false</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/InterruptedException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">InterruptedException</a></code> - if the current thread is interrupted while waiting.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/InterruptedException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">InterruptedException</a></code> - 如果在等待期间当前线程被中断。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>timeout</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>timeout</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Christoph Strobl, Mark Paluch",
      "translation": "克里斯托夫·施特罗布，马克·帕卢赫",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "true if the subscription is currently executed.",
      "translation": "如果订阅当前正在执行，则为 true。",
      "count": 1
    }
  ]
